    "Details": "Marik factories continued to be the driving force behind further improvements to the Crusader. Kallon intermittently experimented with reduced speed and greater jump capacity, but ultimately consolidated the new weapons suite—mating multi-missile and Streak launchers with light PPCs—with the -5M’s movement profile to create the CRD-7M.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable Weapons</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>",
